          "[BLIST][LI] [icon:CITY_BUILDING_LIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_BUILDINGS_TOOLTIP]Culture Buildings[/TIP] gain an adjacency for Coast.[LI][B]+1 [icon:SPECIALIST][/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SPECIALIST_LIMIT_TOOLTIP]Specialist Limit[/TIP] in [icon:CITY_URBAN] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_DISTRICT_TOOLTIP]Districts[/TIP] on or adjacent to Coast.[LI]If you transition away from the Majapahit, the [icon:SPECIALIST] Specialist Limit increase goes away. [icon:SPECIALIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SPECIALIST_TOOLTIP]Specialists[/TIP] over the Limit become inactive until you increase the Limit.[LI][B]+30% [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production[/B] towards constructing Borobudur.[/BLIST]"
