          "[BLIST][LI][B]+5 [icon:NAR_REW_COMBAT][/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Combat Strength[/TIP] for [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_LAND_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Land Units[/TIP] and [icon:CITY_FORTIFIED] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_FORTIFIED_DISTRICTS_TOOLTIP]Fortified Districts[/TIP] adjacent to Coast.[LI][B]+25 [icon:Action_Heal] HP[/B] on [icon:CITY_FORTIFIED] Fortified Districts.[LI][B]+30% [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production[/B] towards constructing the White Tower.[/BLIST]"
