          "[BLIST][LI][B]+1 [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY] Influence, +3[icon:YIELD_CULTURE] Culture and +3[icon:YIELD_SCIENCE] Science[/B] for every [B][icon:UNIT_ARMY_COMMANDER] Army[/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMMANDER_TOOLTIP]Commander[/TIP] XP earned in Combat. [LI][B][icon:YIELD_CULTURE] Culture[/B] [B][icon:CITY_BUILDING_LIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_BUILDINGS_TOOLTIP]Buildings[/TIP][/B] no longer receive an Adjacency with [B][icon:CITY_UNIMPROVED] Mountain Terrain[/B]. [LI][B][icon:YIELD_SCIENCE] Science[/B] [B][icon:CITY_BUILDING_LIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_BUILDINGS_TOOLTIP]Buildings[/TIP][/B] no longer receive an Adjacency with [B][icon:RADIAL_RESOURCES] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_RESOURCES_TOOLTIP]Resources[/TIP][/B]. [LI][B]+30%[icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production [/B]towards constructing [B]Himeji Castle[/B].[/LIST]"
