         "paragraphs": [
          "[BLIST][LI][B]+2 [icon:YIELD_FOOD] Food[/B], [B]+2 [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold[/B] and [B]+2 [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production[/B] in [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP]Settlements[/TIP] adjacent to Coast and in Settlements following your own [icon:NAR_REW_RELIGION] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_RELIGION_TOOLTIP]Religion[/TIP], or +4 if it is both. Doubled in Settlements in [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_DISTANT_LANDS_TOOLTIP]Distant Lands[/TIP].[LI][B]+15% [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold[/B] towards converting a [icon:YIELD_TOWNS] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_TOWN_TOOLTIP]Town[/TIP] to a [icon:YIELD_CITIES] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CITIES_TOOLTIP]City[/TIP], or [B]+30% [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold[/B] in Settlements in Distant Lands.[LI][B]+30% [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production[/B] towards constructing El Escorial.[/BLIST]"
         ]
