          "[BLIST][LI]Gain a unique [icon:ENDEAVOR] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_ENDEAVOR_TOOLTIP]Endeavor[/TIP] called Friend of Wei that can be performed in an [icon:PLAYER_RELATIONSHIP_ALLIANCE] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_ALLIANCE_TOOLTIP]Alliance[/TIP] to grant you and your ally +25% [icon:YIELD_SCIENCE] Science.[LI]+4 [icon:YIELD_SCIENCE] Science per [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP] for every Leader you are [icon:PLAYER_RELATIONSHIP_FRIENDLY] Friendly or [icon:PLAYER_RELATIONSHIP_HELPFUL] Helpful with.[LI]Can Support [icon:ENDEAVOR] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_ENDEAVOR_TOOLTIP]Endeavors[/TIP] for free, but Rejecting [icon:DIPLOMATIC_ACTION] Diplomatic Actions costs +100% [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY] Influence.[/BLIST]"
