          "[BLIST][LI]Gain 100 [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold per [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP] every time you discover a [icon:NOTIFICATION_DISCOVER_NATURAL_WONDER] Natural Wonder. This is doubled if the Natural Wonder is in [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_DISTANT_LANDS_TOOLTIP]Distant Lands[/TIP].[LI]+50% tile yields from [icon:NOTIFICATION_DISCOVER_NATURAL_WONDER] Natural Wonders for every Natural Wonder in your Empire.[LI]+50% [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold towards purchasing [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_NAVAL_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Naval Units[/TIP].[LI]-1 [icon:YIELD_GOLD] [B]Gold[/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_MAINTENANCE_TOOLTIP]maintenance[/TIP] for [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_NAVAL_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Naval Units[/TIP].[/BLIST]"
