          "[BLIST][LI]When gaining rewards from a [icon:NAR_REW_DEFAULT] Narrative Event, gain an additional 20 [icon:YIELD_CULTURE] Culture, [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold and [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY] Influence per [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP].[LI]Has additional [icon:NAR_REW_DEFAULT] Narrative Events.[LI]+50% [icon:CELEBRATION] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CELEBRATIONS_TOOLTIP]Celebration[/TIP] duration.[LI]+50% [icon:YIELD_HAPPINESS] Happiness towards [icon:CELEBRATION] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CELEBRATIONS_TOOLTIP]Celebrations[/TIP].[/BLIST]"
