          "[BLIST][LI]All [icon:CITY_BUILDING_LIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_BUILDINGS_TOOLTIP]Buildings[/TIP] receive a +1 [icon:YIELD_FOOD] Food Adjacency for Mountains.[LI]-2 [icon:YIELD_HAPPINESS] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_MAINTENANCE_TOOLTIP]Maintenance[/TIP] on [icon:SPECIALIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SPECIALIST_TOOLTIP]Specialists[/TIP] adjacent to Mountains. +1 [icon:YIELD_HAPPINESS] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_MAINTENANCE_TOOLTIP]Maintenance[/TIP] on [icon:SPECIALIST] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SPECIALIST_TOOLTIP]Specialists[/TIP] not adjacent to Mountains. [LI][icon:YIELD_CITIES] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CITIES_TOOLTIP]Cities[/TIP] gain a bonus to [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION] Production equal to 10% of that City’s [icon:YIELD_FOOD] Food.[/BLIST]"
