          "[BLIST][LI]Gain the Unique [icon:UNIT_ARMY_COMMANDER] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMMANDER_TOOLTIP]Army Commander[/TIP] Trung Nhi after obtaining your first Land [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_MILITARY_UNIT_TOOLTIP]Military Unit[/TIP] of the [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP]. [icon:UNIT_ARMY_COMMANDER] Trung Nhi persists across [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP] Transitions, and begins with 2 [icon:NAR_REW_PROMOTION] Promotions in Exploration Advanced Starts or 3 [icon:NAR_REW_PROMOTION] Promotions in Modern Advanced Starts, and has a unique  [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_PROMOTION_TOOLTIP]Promotion[/TIP] Tree.[LI]+20% [icon:UNIT_ARMY_COMMANDER] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMMANDER_EXPERIENCE_TOOLTIP]Commander Experience[/TIP].[LI]+10% [icon:YIELD_SCIENCE] Science in [icon:YIELD_CITIES] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CITIES_TOOLTIP]Cities[/TIP] in Tropical. This is doubled while in a [icon:WAR] Formal War you declare.[/BLIST]"
