            "Hawaiian Unique Missionary. Has an action to [icon:Action_Heal] Heal adjacent Units. Receive 25[icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold when you convert a [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP]Settlement[/TIP]."
