            "Joseon Unique Heavy Naval Unit. Has -3 Ranged and [icon:BOMBARD_STRENGTH] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Bombard Strength[/TIP] than other Tier 1 Heavy [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_NAVAL_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Naval Units[/TIP]. Has [B]+10 [icon:BOMBARD_STRENGTH] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Bombard Strength[/TIP][/B] and [B]+7 [icon:RANGED_STRENGTH] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Ranged Strength[/TIP][/B] when the Turtle Ship is on Coast."
