         "paragraphs": [
          "[B]+2 [icon:YIELD_PRODUCTION][/B]. Grants a free [icon:UNIT_ARMY_COMMANDER] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMMANDER_TOOLTIP]Army Commander[/TIP] when built. [B]+25%[/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMMANDER_EXPERIENCE_TOOLTIP]Commander Experience[/TIP]. [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGELESS_TOOLTIP]Ageless[/TIP]. Must be placed on Grassland."
         ]
